<section id="faq" class="page" hidden><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE PROJECT</p><h1>ISLANDS · FAQ</h1><p>Collect the world, one island at a time. A geography-led art collection being developed on Base.</p>
<article class="panel"><h2>What is ISLANDS?</h2><p>ISLANDS is a planned collection of individually created island artworks, inspired by real coastlines and terrain. Explore islands through the Atlas, then discover their art editions as they are released.</p></article>
<article class="panel"><h2>How are the artworks created?</h2><p>Each draft uses geographic coastline and elevation data as a foundation, transformed into a distinctive Soft Stone visual style. Artworks are reviewed before release; the map and artistic interpretation are not intended for navigation.</p></article>
<article class="panel"><h2>What are North-Up and South-Up?</h2><p>Two orientations of an island artwork: north at the top or south at the top. Their palettes may differ. Editions are planned separately, and final supply will be announced before minting.</p></article>
<article class="panel"><h2>How will minting work?</h2><p>Three planned modes: Discovery (random island), Expedition (choose a region) and Destination (choose an island and edition). Prices shown in the app are proposals, not live offers. No editions are currently available to mint.</p></article>
<article class="panel"><h2>What do BaseFriend Creator Keys do?</h2><p>Staked Creator Keys are planned to unlock mint discounts of up to 25%. The current pricing slider is a simulation, not verified wallet eligibility. Integration is under development.</p></article>
<article class="panel"><h2>Can I pay with $KEY or $CHEERS?</h2><p>$KEY is the proposed reference currency. $CHEERS payment and tipping features are planned, but not yet active. No live exchange quote or payment transaction is offered here.</p></article>
<article class="panel"><h2>Can I trade or swap islands?</h2><p>Secondary sales and island swaps are part of the roadmap. The Trade section is a preview; there is no active marketplace or swap contract yet.</p></article>
<article class="panel"><h2>What is the BaseFriend connection?</h2><p>ISLANDS is being built as a Farcaster Mini App with BaseFriend Creator Key discovery, future staking-based benefits, and planned $CHEERS appreciation for island owners. These are development goals, not launched rewards.</p><a href="https://basefriend.tech/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore BaseFriend ↗</a></article>
<article class="panel"><h2>Project status &amp; builder grant</h2><p>The World Atlas, directory, preview gallery and key lookup are under active development. A proposed builder grant would support verified staking discounts, onchain minting, owner tipping and a stronger art review workflow. A grant has not been awarded.</p></article>
</section>
